<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Hoare Govett ups UK food retailers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hoare Govett ups UK food retailers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK food retail sector was raised to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;underweight&quot; at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
